  "id": "anxiety-sensitivity",
  "term": "anxiety sensitivity",
  "definition": "Anxiety sensitivity is a tendency for some people to become more anxious when they notice certain sensations, especially during observation of their internal experience. In this packet, it is described as elevated in some individuals, including some people with panic disorder.",
