      "reasons": [
        "The packet does not define anxiety sensitivity as a general tendency; it only says some individuals with elevated anxiety sensitivity note heightened anxiety when observing particular sensations.",
        "“Especially during observation of their internal experience” is not supported by the packet and adds a mindfulness/internal-experience framing that is not stated.",
        "“In this packet, it is described as elevated in some individuals, including some people with panic disorder” overstates the source: the packet says some individuals, particularly those with panic disorder or elevated anxiety sensitivity, note heightened anxiety, but it does not define anxiety sensitivity as something “elevated” in the way the definition suggests."
